# SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT-0
# A product with one variant group, "return" (what returns the arm to its rest), in the shape the sources hold it.
# The base product is the default option "cord": the ES arm joins the FR frame at its return eye (IF-01) and lock pin
# (IF-04), the ES pedal at its heel eye (IF-02) and toe eye (IF-05); IF-03 joins the frame and the pedal under every
# option. The rows the sites hold only for the option "spring" carry its code: the UK spring and the DE anchor block
# (released to DE only), the frame's spring anchor bore and the pedal's heel eye turned a quarter turn (ES-PEDAL-R05).
# The options graph is fixtures/variants-options.ttl.

